{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"4901009160010","name":"霧子","text":"わ……\r\nもらって……いいんですか……？","trans":"哇……\n我可以……收下吗……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-4","name":"プロデューサー","text":"おう、もちろんだ\r\n──大したものじゃないんだけどな","trans":"嗯，当然\n──不过也不是什么大不了的东西","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901009160020","name":"霧子","text":"ふふ……\r\nコト……コト……","trans":"呵呵……\n咚咚……咚咚……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901009160030","name":"霧子","text":"────\r\nいいものです……","trans":"────\n是好东西……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"はは、ハードル上げないでくれよ？","trans":"哈哈，别把门槛抬那么高啊？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-10","name":"プロデューサー","text":"──ああ、でも……\r\n俺も、溶けないやつにしたから","trans":"──啊，不过……\n我也是选了不会化掉的那种","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901009160040","name":"霧子","text":"……！\r\nそれじゃあ……やっぱり……","trans":"……！\n那么……果然……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901009160050","name":"霧子","text":"いいものです……","trans":"是好东西……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-13","name":"プロデューサー","text":"だといいなぁ","trans":"但愿如此啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}